{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"extern","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOption","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:MLNShapeSource.h@T@MLNShapeSourceOption","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOption"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first object determines how the attribute values are accumulated from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cluster points. It is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"type":"text","text":" with an expression function that accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two or more arguments, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sum"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"max"},{"type":"text","text":". The arguments should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"featureAccumulated"},{"type":"text","text":" and the previously defined feature attribute key. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting value is assigned to the specified attribute key."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The second "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"type":"text","text":" in the array determines which"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute values are accessed from individual features within a cluster.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let firstExpression = NSExpression(format: \"sum:({$featureAccumulated, sumValue})\")","let secondExpression = NSExpression(forKeyPath: \"magnitude\")","let clusterPropertiesDictionary = [\"sumValue\" : [firstExpression, secondExpression]]","","let options : [MLNShapeSourceOption : Any] = [.clustered : true,","                                           .clusterProperties: clusterPropertiesDictionary]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This option corresponds to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clusterProperties"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source property in the MapLibre Style Spec."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This option only affects point features within an ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object; it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is ignored when creating an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource"},{"text":" object.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"var","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Global Variable","externalID":"c:@MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionclusterproperties"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSDictionary"},{"type":"text","text":" object where the key is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSString"},{"type":"text","text":". The dictionary key will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be the feature attribute key. The resulting attribute value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aggregated from the clustered points. The dictionary value is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSArray"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consisting of two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"type":"text","text":" objects."}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOption":{"title":"MLNShapeSourceOption","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOption","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Options for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoption","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOption","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"title":"MLNShape","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNCompu